        "original_id": "c9ed5436-d21d-5403-ba04-0f88a09a2e2a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bob Dylan, Byron De La Beckwith, Medgar Evers\n- Works: \"Only a Pawn in Their Game\"\n- Topics: assassination of Medgar Evers, civil rights, white supremacy\n\nFacts:\n- On June 12, 1963, Medgar Wiley Evers was assassinated.\n- Byron De La Beckwith, Sr. was an American white supremacist and Klansman from Greenwood, Mississippi.\n- In 1994, Byron De La Beckwith was convicted of assassinating Medgar Wiley Evers.\n- Bob Dylan wrote the song \"Only a Pawn in Their Game\" about the assassination of civil rights activist Medgar Evers.",
